    <statement><p>Give a parametric equation of the line which passes through <m>A(-1,1,-3)</m> and <m>B(0,4,-7)</m>.  Use <m>t</m> as the 
parameter for all of your answers.</p>
<p><m>x(t) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>y(t) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_1"/></p>
<p><m>z(t) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="MuLtIaNsWeR_AnSwEr0001_2"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-1+1t;\,1+3t;\,-3+\left(-4\right)t</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
